  "conclusion": [
    "End investment applies floor(money * C901 / 100) and adds that amount to current money in simple mode.",
    "Recruitment spends one taler per soldier and adds soldiers directly to the player's home province; there is no free-troop or reserve pool.",
    "Village purchase uses sys:L9A2A for cap, clamps max to min(missing villages, floor(money / C900)), and spends chosenCount * C900.",
    "Human fortification upgrade costs main:L300F[currentFort], increments the fort by one, and sets C832 bit $20 so the same province cannot be upgraded again in that investment phase."
